            <ArticleTitle>The Small-Carrion prosthesis for male impotency.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>289-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Small-Carrion penile prostheses were implanted in 61 patients who have been followed for 3 to 21 months. Of these 61 patients 55 have achieved satisfactory results, with a return of normal sexual function. The importance of preoperative evaluation and preparation is stressed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
